<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-WORLD SERIES TOURNAMENT STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WORLD SERIES TOURNAMENT STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE, Australia 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standings in the</p>
<p>World Series triangular limited overs cricket tournament after</p>
<p>Tuesday's match (tabulate under played, won, lost, points):</p>
<p>    Australia     3    2    1    4</p>
<p>    Pakistan	2    1    1    2</p>
<p>    West Indies   3    1    2    2</p>
</text>
